d time slots. Each slot has time, title, speaker and room.":["G\u00fcn ve zaman dilimleri ekleyin. Her dilimin saati, ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131, konu\u015fmac\u0131s\u0131 ve odas\u0131 vard\u0131r."],"Create":["Olu\u015ftur"],"Edit event app":[""],"Shown in the wallet and email (e.g. \"Opera evening\", \"Zoo visit\"). Empty = use the global default.":["C\u00fczdanda ve e-postada g\u00f6sterilir (\u00f6rn. \"Opera gecesi\", \"Hayvanat bah\u00e7esi ziyareti\"). Bo\u015f = genel varsay\u0131lan\u0131 kullan\u0131r."],"Active":["Etkin"],"Save the congress first to add pages and sections.":["Sayfa ve b\u00f6l\u00fcm eklemek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce kongresi kaydedin."],"Add":["Ekle"],"Expired":["S\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f"],"Turn off to hide this congress everywhere (page + wallet) without unassigning it \u2014 e.g. to publish the info only later.":["Bu kongreyi her yerde (sayfa + c\u00fczdan) atamay\u0131 kald\u0131rmadan gizlemek i\u00e7in kapat\u0131n \u2014 \u00f6rn. bilgiyi daha sonra yay\u0131nlamak i\u00e7in."],"Slug for new edition:":["Yeni bask\u0131 i\u00e7in k\u0131sa ad:"],"Add speaker":["Konu\u015fmac\u0131 ekle"],"Title and slug are required.":["Ba\u015fl\u0131k ve k\u0131sa ad zorunludur."],"Program":["Program"],"Updated":["G\u00fcncellendi"],"Products":["\u00dcr\u00fcnler"],"Speaker":["Konu\u015fmac\u0131"],"Pick files from the media library. Label is shown to visitors. Drag to reorder.":["Medya k\u00fct\u00fcphanesinden dosya se\u00e7in. Etiket ziyaret\u00e7ilere g\u00f6sterilir. S\u0131ralamak i\u00e7in s\u00fcr\u00fckleyin."],"Unique identifier for this congress. Visitors open it through their personal ticket link, not the slug.":["Bu kongre i\u00e7in benzersiz tan\u0131mlay\u0131c\u0131. Ziyaret\u00e7iler buna ki\u015fisel bilet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u00fczerinden eri\u015fir, k\u0131sa addan de\u011fil."],"Choose":["Se\u00e7"],"Save congress":["Kongresi kaydet"],"Delete page?":["Sayfa silinsin mi?"],"Save":["Kaydet"],"Assign via the WooCommerce produ